+{"pid": 2085900, "iteration": 3, "phase": "iteration_start", "last_beat": "2026-06-10T10:15:22Z"}
\ No newline at end of file
diff --git a/ops/conductor-log.md b/ops/conductor-log.md
index 6c92589573..30bdc23127 100644
--- a/ops/conductor-log.md
+++ b/ops/conductor-log.md
@@ -8166,3 +8166,4 @@ c |
 | 2026-06-10 08:22 UTC | Archive .369 -> activate .370; HARDENED GREEN-GATE | FAIL | Gemini CLI error: Stalled after 600s silence. Last output: Warning: 256-color  |
